      "content": "but what if the \"bouncing back\" part is just way too much work? i feel like i'm just carrying around this heavy, broken version of myself now. they loved the person i was, but they won't love this person. it feels like it would be easier to just let that version of me stay perfect in their heads forever, instead of making them watch me struggle and fail for years.",
